      "content": "It makes perfect sense that the idea of \"finding a new purpose\" feels like an overwhelming chore when you've dedicated so much to monumental things. You are right; the feeling of obligation when the big mission is done is exhausting. Instead of searching for a grand mission, maybe the focus could shift to finding moments of quiet peace or simple comfort in the present.",
